# NOITE's prison escape (3farmcai) starts the real SERIAL, which loses: the
# killers take the five lives (at 35810 ms in the Original, 25810 with the
# fixes).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3farmcai --ms 39000 --input tools/play/serial-3farmcai-lose.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3farmcai --ms 39000 --fix all,-serial_intro_screen,-serial_end_screen --input tools/play/serial-3farmcai-lose.input
#
# As serial-3farmcai-win: SERIAL starts at 3210. The shots are
# `tools/serial_plan.py --start 3210 --lose`: kinds 0 and 1 only, in
# either version (they play different games, BUGS.md K5).
# - Original: +100; the result is still a win (BUGS.md K1) of
#   MAKELONG(0, 100) = 6553600 (K2): NOITE keeps its 3 lives, adds 6553600
#   and, the jail fight not won, goes back to the prison;
# - `--fix all`: +300; a loss of 300: NOITE adds 300, takes a life (2
#   left) and goes back to the prison.
